# Pipeline-parallel 4. Copy to ../.env (or add the LAYOUT line to your .env)
# and run ./start.sh restart. Faster prefill and about twice the KV pool, for
# many parallel users, long prompts and cards limited to x4 links. Uses only
# settings from ../.env.example; everything not set here, including the
# layout's own prefill chunk, follows the release defaults for pp4.
LAYOUT=pp4
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# PORT=8000
# API_KEY=
# SERVED_MODEL_NAME=glm-5.3-flash
